      "en": "Their eyes were opened, and they both knew that they were naked. They sewed fig leaves together, and made coverings for themselves.",
      "ko": "이에 그들의 눈이 밝아 자기들의 몸이 벗은 줄을 알고 무화과나무 잎을 엮어 치마를 하였더라",
      "source_text_hash": "874cba5019430fb12e79394d5ad0099f8d79ef0ffebdb13234950c8c0742208a",
      "translation_text_hash": "354a1f4c6c8f178d5925b3400aae265d5fbee87ed448c1dff54108facb7f04d2",
